    <body>
      <div facs="#zone_headline">
        <head><hi rendition="#c #in"><lb/><name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name></hi></head>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_subheadline">
        <head><hi rendition="#c #b"><lb/>Reproduktionsklaver.</hi></head>
      </div>
      <div type="illustration" facs="#zone_picture">
        <figure><desc>The Welte-Mignon cabinet player (Vorsetzer) in an Art Nouveau case</desc></figure>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_left">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c #b"><lb/>Elegant
          <lb/>Ydre</hi></ab>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_right">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c #b"><seg xml:id="topic_1" ana="#technical_invention" type="topic" resp="#claude"><lb/>Drives ved
          <lb/>Elektromotor</seg></hi></ab>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_text">
        <p><lb/><seg xml:id="topic_2" ana="#exact_reproduction" type="topic" resp="#claude">Gjengiver direkte Virtuosernes Spil med alle Finheder</seg>
          <lb/>og med <seg xml:id="topic_3" ana="#personality" type="topic" resp="#claude">alle individuelle Karakteregenskaber</seg>.
          <lb/>Klaverstykkerne er forespillet <sic>at</sic> Verdens første Com-
          <lb/>ponister som:
          <lb/><hi rendition="#b"><persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118697641">Grieg</persName>, <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118986724">Paderewski</persName>, <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/119110016">Dohnanyi</persName></hi> etc., der alle har <seg xml:id="topic_4" ana="#miracle" type="topic" resp="#claude"><sic>ndtrykt</sic> sin
          <lb/>Forbauselse og Beundring</seg> over <seg xml:id="topic_5" ana="#exact_reproduction" type="topic" resp="#claude">den i mindste Detail nøiagtige
          <lb/>Gjengivelse</seg>.</p>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_demonstration">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c #b"><lb/>Forespilles daglig Interessenter.</hi></ab>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_signature">
